  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><ul><li><p><strong><span class=\"citation-2\">About our brand and products:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2 citation-end-2\"> PussyWhipped is a brand offering humorous and quirky merchandise for cat lovers, including t-shirts, apparel, mugs, and stickers.</span> The brand is connected to the hour-long stand-up comedy special, \"PussyWhipped and Proud.\" All products are available through the Ottomic Blue Collectibles website.</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted\"><br></div><p><br></p></li><li><p><strong>What makes us different:</strong> Our brand is deeply rooted in a unique stand-up comedy special that highlights the shared, and often absurd, experiences of cat owners. We have a distinct \"Master Thespian\" delivery style and use subtle callbacks to a song called \"Hey Love.\" We are more than just a clothing line; we are a \"secret society\" for cat people. Additionally, 10% of all PussyWhipped brand proceeds are donated to animal rescue organizations.</p></li><li><p><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong> As an affiliate on the UpPromote platform, you can earn commissions on sales generated through your unique affiliate link. You can promote our products to your audience and receive a percentage of each sale you drive.</p></li><li><p><strong>How to promote us:</strong> You can promote us by sharing our video ad for the white cat dad jersey on social media. You can also utilize our specific keywords to optimize your content, including <code>cat lover gifts</code>, <code>funny \"pussy whipped\" cat lover shirt</code>, <code>sarcastic cat mom apparel</code>, and <code>unique gifts for men who love cats</code>. Furthermore, sharing snippets or information about the stand-up special helps to contextualize the brand and its humor.</p></li><li><p><strong>Other information:</strong> The PussyWhipped brand is a work in progress with an inactive LLC and pending trademark/copyrights. Our products are sold through the Ottomic Blue Collectibles website, which also represents the professional endeavors of Ottomic Blue (an MC in the Hip Hop scene.</p></li></ul></div></div>",
